     
@RFQDetailsModule
Feature: RFQ item management

  Scenario: Add item from Excel sheet and send to Vendor successfully
    Given User is on the RFQ details page
    When User clicks on "Add Row" button
    And User enters item details from Excel sheet "src/resources/testdata/RFQ_Items.xlsx"
     And User clicks on "Send Email" button
      And User creates a new version
     And User adds a note "Please review and submit your best quote"
     And User selects vendors "Test_1,Test_2"
     And clicks on save button
     And User sends the email
    Then item should be added and email sent to vendor successfully
         